1- Install VScode 
2- Install NodeJS
3- Install React JS
	npx create-react-app ipfs-dapp
4- Install Truffle 
5- Install Ganache 
6- Init Truffle in react project 
	truffle init 
7- Configure truffle to match Ganache in react project 
8- Start your project 
	npm start
9- Delete the build directory 
10-Create new build directory in the public folder of React 
11-Change the configuration of truffle 
	contracts_build_directory:"./public/abis"
12-App.js contains your front end
13-Install node js packages 
	npm i web3 
	npm i @metamask/detect-provider
	npm i ipfs
	npm i ipfs-http-client
	npm i npm install bootstrap@v5.3.8
	npm audit fix --force
	
	(Use in case of error with react scripts)
	npm install react-scripts --save
	npm install react-scripts@latest 
14-Import bootstrap to index.js 
	import 'bootstrap'
15-Design your front end 
	from bootstrap docs bring the components 
	change all class to className
16-Write the cloud smart contract under contracts 
17-Write the Cloud migration code 
18-run truffle migrate
	truffle migrate --reset 
19-Move to Solidity 0.8.0 for more stable execution

	
